{{also|druse|Druse}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|drües}}, from {{inh|de|goh|druosi}}, plural of {{m|goh|druos}}, which originally referred to a swelling on the body. The current singular form is based on the historical plural.

